**{{ lastSpeaker.name }} spoke to {{ lastDialogueTarget.name }}.**

# Candidates

{% for candidate in candidateDialogues %}
{% if candidate.UUID and candidate.UUID != 0 %}
{% set cinfo = decnpc(candidate.UUID) %}
{{ candidate.id }}. **{{ cinfo.name }}**{% if hasExchange and candidate.UUID == lastDialogueTarget.UUID %} **[RECIPIENT]**{% endif %}{% if hasExchange and candidate.UUID == lastSpeaker.UUID %} **[PREVIOUS SPEAKER]**{% endif %}{% if not cinfo.isVirtual and is_follower(candidate.UUID) %} **[FOLLOWER]**{% endif %}{% if not cinfo.isVirtual and tagEngaged and is_in_package(candidate.UUID, "SkyrimNet_PlayerFollowPackage") %} **[ENGAGED]**{% endif %}{% if not cinfo.isVirtual and tagInScene and (is_in_faction(candidate.UUID, "SexLabAnimatingFaction") or is_in_faction(candidate.UUID, "OStimExcitementFaction")) %} **[IN SCENE]**{% endif %}{% if cinfo.isVirtual %} **[VIRTUAL NPC]**{% endif %}
   - {% if not cinfo.isVirtual %}{{ cinfo.gender }} {{ cinfo.race }}, {{ units_to_meters(candidate.distance) }}m — {% endif %}{{ render_character_profile("short_inline", candidate.UUID) }}
   - **Interjection:** {{ render_character_profile("interject_inline", candidate.UUID) }}
{% if playerNonFollowerExchange and not cinfo.isVirtual and is_follower(candidate.UUID) and followerInterruption >= 4 %}
   - **Personality:** {{ render_character_profile("bio_personality", candidate.UUID) }}
{% elif hasExchange and not cinfo.isVirtual and not is_follower(candidate.UUID) and candidate.UUID != lastSpeaker.UUID and candidate.UUID != lastDialogueTarget.UUID and nonFollowerInterruption == 4 %}
   - **Personality:** {{ render_character_profile("bio_personality", candidate.UUID) }}
{% endif %}
{% endif %}
{% endfor %}

# Target

{% if playerSpoke %}
- A responding `[RECIPIENT]` targets `player`.
{% else %}
- A responding `[RECIPIENT]` targets {{ lastSpeaker.name }}.
{% endif %}
- An interruption targets the person the selected candidate is reacting to or addressing.
- Write `player` in lowercase when the player is the target.
- Otherwise use an exact full candidate name.
- Never omit the target.

Examples:

- `0`
- `Lydia>player`
- `Aela the Huntress>Lydia`

Return the answer now:
[ end user ]
